    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "so it's like an infestation... that makes it sound even more invasive. does it feel like these particles are just \"there,\" or is there a sense that they are actively undermining the body's defenses? like, are they just passive guests or are they more like little pests that are constantly picking at the walls and causing damage from the shadows?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
